      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "yes I highly support this I even made a similar post about it myself voicing my frustration about the fact that they don't announce significant things such as the dynamic bone limiter in game. there's a hundred different ways they could do this and then I wouldn't have to be in like 20 different Discord servers constantly repeating to people that their Dynamic bones aren't broken and that they just need to turn off the limiter or modify its values.\n\nBecause the simple fact is most people don't read the patch notes so there's a bit of panic sometimes when significant changes like that are implemented. get a simple push notification or even just like a notification in the loading screen or whatever could dispel most of that by simply saying hey we added this new thing you might want to know about",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
